    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Plots the first few 1D particle-in-a-box wavefunctions (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.particle_in_box.ParticleInBox1D), each offset by its own energy level, then checks the textbook 3D cubic-box degeneracy pattern (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.particle_in_box.ParticleInBox3D), and finally applies Kuhn&#x27;s free-electron model (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.particle_in_box.conjugated_dye_absorption_wavelength) to predict how a cyanine dye&#x27;s absorption color shifts with conjugation length.">

